"'{number}' in the URL where the caller's phone number should go.\n"
"\n"
"For example: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"When you tap the search button during a call, we will replace '{number}' "
"with the actual phone number and open it in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"Antre URL ou vle itilize pou chèche nimewo enkoni. Mete '{number}' nan URL "
"kote nimewo telefòn moun kap rele a ta dwe ale.\n"
"\n"
"Pa egzanp: https://mysearch.com/?q={number}\n"
"\n"
"Lè w tape bouton rechèch la pandan yon apèl, n ap ranplase '{number}' ak "
"nimewo telefòn aktyèl la epi n ap louvri l nan navigatè defo ou a."

